"SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "26386754664251618", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "1885230755691361"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "ss12.png", "id": "2175774379917399", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618103_2175774383250732_8076768027270501944_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=q5RypzcbnvEQ7kNvwHDeyXo&_nc_oc=Adrd0nE1YFDVo5eF5-80wAmopcEFnp5laKeOxLpAV68rRxSZTAeAwE2tm7mGW4kRCjM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5x9aikxlj6pyVZrQ24ltXy0YamYbFzYu-a5GLmxXIu5Q&oe=69FF2248"}, {"file_name": "ss11.png", "id": "2137699910339220", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618288_2137699913672553_7423868979154946533_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZVJUiXG-JRcQ7kNvwHGFHPG&_nc_oc=AdofG-2uinJGdrSlVccsT4INqfxNVF-_JLvTIRz57Z-QtLz5jOXdyeuBuZyBJDeKWSs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7r18M0PE4MHhFPIpk8Jc3YXFntcyl8oXqzW3E1tqT1cQ&oe=69FF3A0C"}, {"file_name": "ss20.png", "id": "2026270254590937", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823366_2026270257924270_6876216673136844395_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0q4_hS90EQwQ7kNvwH8mBic&_nc_oc=Ado_UE8HOoLF-yzZfAYcH8cEl1YPCGU1AH3FgrSKwPDEQ9qYPR84hppHaOmXBc8O_QI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4BEnMUhMR-VDhT8aqe1YjUurTUi-H4ThhXutRDQm2GxA&oe=69FF504E"}, {"file_name": "ss10.png", "id": "1616871636189416", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499309561_1616871639522749_3073266000227229010_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wHOm-zHRrJIQ7kNvwEfdtKn&_nc_oc=Adp4hgPeDO9nlqrQfAi3XLTk66jcXotHUGN8gtHqPJS9LveNwd6s03lU5lJ6uesyufI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6AIpn-CYOQoCs_qHiYqk_-_eieytUdrtXW2rX1Z3hFvw&oe=69FF4B16"}, {"file_name": "499617850_2219903915212734_8826469387072428556_n.png", "id": "1310525854314591", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828038_1310525857647924_3775834342589674906_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KxSdeKUc2k0Q7kNvwGGCmYz&_nc_oc=Adr2TLVXilosBdo6gxiWposu-8IEo6K8eoT7bArZDcoJwwDtMHOBZ-9tOX_SKSI1pTs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4-xIR7DURyYWvUSblv6T8ta3sJRliLStmL5ljbpbRonA&oe=69FF4343"}, {"file_name": "499619805_892340833760895_3223583406558202226_n.png", "id": "980353391206311", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821704_980353401206310_1750651195155501886_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Wah64-DVrEsQ7kNvwHsr_my&_nc_oc=Ado3Z3WfWkZkcfscBZL6ROEhRKqn5wvgxbBcJwdk5OcEfB0faTUy7AipSlWjkd7j4ag&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6tLk6KpAji5fIz6wGYk3U4i4agKgXg2gpqappDPi0tJg&oe=69FF2D2A"}]}, "id": "1690778922335846", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Cup Strike", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Cup Strike es un juego de disparos basado en la f\u00edsica, dise\u00f1ado para una experiencia inmersiva. Apunta a torres de vasos apilados colocadas a diferentes distancias y pon a prueba tu precisi\u00f3n y concentraci\u00f3n.\n\nEl juego ahora incluye un nuevo panel de configuraci\u00f3n que te brinda control total sobre tu experiencia de forma simple e intuitiva. Puedes personalizar f\u00e1cilmente la apariencia y la sensaci\u00f3n del juego sin interrumpir la partida.\n\n{2026270254590937}\n\n- Cambia el dise\u00f1o de los vasos seg\u00fan tu estilo\n- Reinicia las torres al instante para volver a intentarlo r\u00e1pidamente\n- Activa o desactiva el movimiento de la mesa para un desaf\u00edo estable o  din\u00e1mico\n- Ajusta los colores del cielo para crear el ambiente que prefieras\n- Cambia entre diferentes escenarios para una experiencia renovada\n\nCon controles suaves y una opci\u00f3n de reinicio r\u00e1pido, todo est\u00e1 dise\u00f1ado para ser \u00e1gil y sin complicaciones. Esta flexibilidad hace que Cup Strike VR sea f\u00e1cil de disfrutar a tu propio ritmo, ya sea para una sesi\u00f3n tranquila o un desaf\u00edo m\u00e1s intenso.\n\n{980353391206311}\n\nCada disparo ofrece una f\u00edsica realista: los vasos caen, se dispersan y reaccionan seg\u00fan tu precisi\u00f3n, haciendo que cada acierto sea satisfactorio y cada fallo una oportunidad para mejorar. El reinicio instant\u00e1neo mantiene el juego r\u00e1pido y sin interrupciones.\n\n{1310525854314591}\n\nCon m\u00faltiples entornos y escenarios, el juego se mantiene visualmente fresco. Sus mec\u00e1nicas simples, controles responsivos y jugabilidad fluida hacen que sea f\u00e1cil de empezar y dif\u00edcil de dejar.", "short_description": "Cup Strike es un juego de disparos r\u00e1pido basado en f\u00edsica donde apuntas a torres de vasos apilados desde diferentes distancias. Pon a prueba tu precisi\u00f3n, derriba los vasos con f\u00edsica realista y compite por las puntuaciones m\u00e1s altas. Personaliza los entornos, ajusta la dificultad y reinicia al instante para seguir jugando."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "ss11.png", "id": "2564854617242481", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620817_2564854620575814_6480617183322368310_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=et4o3QZjgoUQ7kNvwEubyeg&_nc_oc=AdrHDkKHdJzm-iFDajnbrl6RsAbs8Uj9lOSwLy4vqPCExWCEg7he5dZqtJARTTQCS9s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6E1WYdN_rpJnE0evupqJKL9uI4D1kX4B6DzftTIrXZHg&oe=69FF3503"}, {"file_name": "ss20.png", "id": "1962632087669404", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1962632091002737_8129632245548559257_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6GFmJuLcdqUQ7kNvwFQIfYg&_nc_oc=AdoUZ8pNzKmgr9bw8nq3mYO4_23_Nk4uWiK7IkrQO5eY0QWiywpuZ5tv2hThpUUVA7M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4PLBfFbcL1QzJYJAeXi-pOFS8DJNWxGJKy_lWva1TQgw&oe=69FF4B90"}, {"file_name": "499617850_2219903915212734_8826469387072428556_n.png", "id": "1601771817756768", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825305_1601771821090101_1416477618242667877_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GgHk9H6at2IQ7kNvwGy2DVa&_nc_oc=AdoAZy2ocpp9kzPh-QdC3JyoopCDzHop5v8_STP9HiOV2f9Bwprq7pHW-12PiUD6lQY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7BM71uorCj_WScDT4V_1q6ECTFsUFoUiPID1KsnwQGIg&oe=69FF40DB"}, {"file_name": "ss12.png", "id": "1456690712130534", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619113_1456690715463867_2923914872486225517_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lB1DqMfOGKYQ7kNvwHgVQRY&_nc_oc=Adoxbfp4dt4xlnBQ7fNoXNALOpSwf5QvqyNPTQi9KdYqv5i4fL02VtqzpwVLPrL-j4o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5ILccgCeSfSGTX0gXUQ-qjOxP3uIOGC84twgEflOmm6A&oe=69FF3BCB"}, {"file_name": "ss10.png", "id": "1335539158407857", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618444_1335539161741190_1225544957109827219_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xBPuynbtV-8Q7kNvwGZpq9m&_nc_oc=AdrmgUIFdHzA9USA_dw2aA46r87fyQ_Zq50yiHExS8Uc8QH71nPaOVP2ksfE7cBRWr0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4wIcgJAGu2hhkReo3TWe2dNneBieVxTFfINriy4zVj7Q&oe=69FF525F"}, {"file_name": "499619805_892340833760895_3223583406558202226_n.png", "id": "1282879336510842", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818852_1282879339844175_679968244535744948_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JLWIACPZwH8Q7kNvwGGUSxL&_nc_oc=AdpDjxuLcudovXUzYv7w17YF83KLm5dusBSKKFuxw5VkqmkNygub0lcfdnbT97Ebg_w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af457gmJ5a5_Pj9TSwhUwwBrH4R_hOogaILGIe8pAGClDQ&oe=69FF4047"}]}, "id": "1532444035152236", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Cup Strike", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Cup Strike est un jeu de tir bas\u00e9 sur la physique, con\u00e7u pour une exp\u00e9rience immersive. Visez des tours de gobelets plac\u00e9es \u00e0 diff\u00e9rentes distances et testez votre pr\u00e9cision.\n\nUn panneau de param\u00e8tres simple et intuitif vous permet de personnaliser facilement votre exp\u00e9rience sans interrompre le jeu.\n\n{1962632087669404}\n\n- Changez le design des gobelets selon votre style pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9\n- Rafra\u00eechissez instantan\u00e9ment les tours pour recommencer rapidement\n- Activez ou d\u00e9sactivez le mouvement de la table pour un d\u00e9fi stable ou dynamique\n- Ajustez les couleurs du ciel pour cr\u00e9er l\u2019ambiance qui vous pla\u00eet\n- Passez d\u2019une sc\u00e8ne \u00e0 une autre pour une exp\u00e9rience renouvel\u00e9e\n\nGr\u00e2ce \u00e0 des contr\u00f4les fluides et \u00e0 une option de r\u00e9initialisation rapide, tout est con\u00e7u pour \u00eatre rapide et sans contrainte. Cette flexibilit\u00e9 rend Cup Strike VR agr\u00e9able \u00e0 votre rythme \u2014 que vous recherchiez une session calme et relaxante ou un d\u00e9fi plus intense.\n\n{1282879336510842}\n\nChaque tir offre une physique r\u00e9aliste : les gobelets tombent, se dispersent et r\u00e9agissent en fonction de votre pr\u00e9cision, rendant chaque r\u00e9ussite satisfaisante et chaque \u00e9chec utile pour progresser. La r\u00e9initialisation instantan\u00e9e des tours permet de garder un rythme de jeu rapide et fluide.\n\n{1601771817756768}\n\nAvec plusieurs environnements et sc\u00e8nes, le jeu reste visuellement vari\u00e9. Des m\u00e9caniques simples, des contr\u00f4les r\u00e9actifs et un gameplay fluide le rendent facile \u00e0 prendre en main et difficile \u00e0 arr\u00eater \u2014 parfait pour se d\u00e9tendre ou jouer de mani\u00e8re comp\u00e9titive.", "short_description": "Cup Strike est un jeu de tir rapide bas\u00e9 sur la physique o\u00f9 vous visez des tours de gobelets empil\u00e9s \u00e0 diff\u00e9rentes distances. Testez votre pr\u00e9cision, faites tomber les gobelets avec une physique r\u00e9aliste et visez les meilleurs scores. Personnalisez les environnements, ajustez la difficult\u00e9 et r\u00e9initialisez instantan\u00e9ment pour continuer \u00e0 jouer."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "3000x900.png", "id": "27038903142367951", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618472_27038903162367949_3080400152376890960_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nl9DO1wF8CUQ7kNvwE8N8sw&_nc_oc=Adoi76hSuEhZft9W-uRwBHorwEWMeoXJPSFWXxMhqBKaV1oLTuuzD5c80V-2fj7nHos&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6EhZZ_Cvc8m_SvYzU5x1UoiEA89F-8ue6TTn_hk7qT8A&oe=69FF2E41"}, {"file_name": "ss20.png", "id": "25989506950751729", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821719_25989506967418394_4482742136262266757_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=96L7lSvm4JIQ7kNvwGf2Q-v&_nc_oc=Adpj-3H434qwv1c5izOxZWhaSUydWad59u6vJFtFcVMxdAmk2kRwM5gu8KgrF5nP338&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7Kyg1tbiJIj65df4R_7GBYSyDnVAZCFea4UFqWHyRtxw&oe=69FF28DA"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence_034_0050 (2) (1).png", "id": "4187237414756350", "i